'''E-Frag.net Esports Club''' was an [[:Category:Bulgaria|Bulgarian]]-[[:Category:Serbia|Serbian]] eSports organization operating under the namesake [http://www.e-frag.net/ E-Frag.net], a gaming portal that provides coverage and news as well as hosting various tournaments for ''Counter-Strike''. While the organization has had ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]'' teams in the past, the official eSports organization was founded in July 2015 with the pickup of former [[GPlay.bg]] roster, [[Mortal Kombat]].

